    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "If you enable route detection, the object reports whether it detects multiple playback routes.",
      "ko": "경로 감지를 활성화하면, 객체가 여러 개의 재생 경로를 감지했는지 보고합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4a2afd0bd98cdbd3c705d99af7098288296107052dfb68ceb5a943058a9704cd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "If it does, use [`AVRoutePickerView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVKit/AVRoutePickerView) to present the UI for the user to select an appropriate route.",
      "ko": "그럴 경우 [`AVRoutePickerView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVKit/AVRoutePickerView)를 사용하여 사용자가 적절한 경로를 선택할 수 있는 UI를 표시합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9f086b95ffa1eaa8670c5b8130f6ce0a76efff0c6876d66cf78f3503e1e7ab1b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
